        "Description": "Four Logic Gate Bit cells as the 4-bit accumulator register, signal names at the IsaAccumulatorSignalMap defaults (ACC.D0\u2013ACC.D3, ACC.LOAD \u2192 ACC.Q0\u2013ACC.Q3), placed below the adder and the RAM so three machine units share one logic network (#1470).",
